{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scrublet 0.2.3 中，mean_center=true 表示将数据居中，使每个基因的均值为 0，此时文档说明会使用 sklearn.decomposition.PCA 进行降维。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "mean_center : bool, optional (default: True)\n            If True, center the data such that each gene has a mean of 0.\n            `sklearn.decomposition.PCA` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "normalize_variance=true 表示将数据归一化，使每个基因的方差为 1；文档说明该参数下会使用 TruncatedSVD，除非 mean_center 为 True。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "normalize_variance : bool, optional (default: True)\n            If True, normalize the data such that each gene has a variance of 1.\n            `sklearn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction, unless `mean_center` is True."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "由于你提供的 mean_center=true 与 normalize_variance=true 同时成立，按文档的“unless mean_center is True”条件，降维路径应选择 PCA 而不是 TruncatedSVD。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "`sklearn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction, unless `mean_center` is True."
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "`sklearn.decomposition.PCA` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
